This repository is a group university assignment submission, made public
on GitHub only so it can be viewed and read (e.g. by markers, future
employers, or other students looking at a portfolio). Making it public
does not give anyone permission to copy, reuse, or submit it, or any part
of it, as their own work.

The work in this repository was produced by the members of CSI1241
Group A. Each group member contributed their own use case screen and
shared sections. "We", "us", and "the group" below mean those members.

You MAY:
  - View, read, and browse the code, text, and content in this repository.

You MAY NOT, without asking us first:
  - Copy, redistribute, or host this code or content elsewhere, in whole
    or in part.
  - Modify this project and/or present it (as-is or changed) as your own
    work, for an assignment, portfolio, job application, or anything else.
  - Reuse any part of this code in another project, even a personal one,
    without clearly crediting the group and linking back to this
    repository.

If something here genuinely inspires a project of your own, that's fine -
just credit us as "CSI1241 Group A" and link back to this repository:
https://github.com/Desandu7000/d7-fmis-ecu

If you are a student and you are reading this because you were thinking
about copying this for your own assignment: please don't. Submitting
someone else's work (or a lightly changed version of it) as your own is
an academic integrity/plagiarism violation at most institutions,
including ours, and it's not worth the risk. Write your own version -
it doesn't have to look like this one to be good.
